            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What two Latin words fused into comment, and what Spanish word shares them? (quo modo — Spanish cómo.) English asks \"what is your name?\" — what does French literally ask? (\"How are you called?\")"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
